<ResourceDictionary xmlns="https://github.com/avaloniaui" xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml">
  <!-- Navigation glyphs, drawn on a 24x24 box so one Path style fits every sidebar row.
       The Windows app uses the same shapes on the same coloured tiles. -->

  <!-- The seven sidebar rows are byte-for-byte the geometry Windows draws in
       Views/Windows/MainWindow.xaml. Earlier rounds hand-drew approximations here and four of
       them ended up as a different picture from Windows: Modes drew sliders where Windows draws
       a gear, Vocabulary a solid book against an outline book, Model Library four loose squares
       against a grid inside a box, and History a clock that had lost its arrow. Copying the
       Windows path data is the only way to keep them from drifting again. -->
