  <!-- E945 LightningBolt: the post-processing chip on every Modes card. Linux drew a four-point
       sparkle here, which repeats ten times on that page.

       The bolt is drawn on a 16.4 x 20 box, not the 11 x 20 it had. Stretch="Uniform" fits the
       longer side, so an 11 x 20 geometry in an 11 x 11 slot scaled to 0.55 and rendered a 6px
       sliver against Windows' 9px. 16.4/20 is Windows' own 9/11 aspect, so the same slot now
       renders 9 x 11 and the bolt reads as chunky rather than as a thin stroke. -->
  <StreamGeometry x:Key="HwIconBolt">M13.2 2 4 13.6h6.2L8.4 22l12-12.4h-6.8L16.6 2z</StreamGeometry>

  <!-- E8A7 OpenInNewWindow: the Docs button on Settings ▸ Local API. Linux drew a circled i. -->
  <StreamGeometry x:Key="HwIconOpenExternal">M5 5h6v2H7v10h10v-4h2v6H5zm8-2h6v6h-2V6.4l-6.3 6.3-1.4-1.4L15.6 5H13z</StreamGeometry>

  <!-- The four Home "Getting Started" glyphs. Windows binds these rows to emoji characters
       (U+1F3A4, U+2328, U+1F3AF, U+1F4DA) in a plain TextBlock and WPF draws Segoe UI Emoji's
       MONOCHROME outlines, so the shapes to match are the emoji's, not a generic icon set's.
       Measured against the reference shot: every glyph's core box starts at x=12 in the 44px
       circle and is 20px wide, and all four share a baseline at y=33 — hence the per-row
       downward nudges on the Path elements in MainWindow.axaml rather than a plain centre.

       These four keys are Home-only on purpose. HwIconStreaming (the condenser mic) and
       HwIconKeyboard (the compact one) are still used by the sidebar tile, the Shortcuts page
       and the model-library row glyph, where a 14px render needs the simpler shape, so the
       detailed Home variants are separate keys instead of edits in place. -->

  <!-- U+1F3A4 MICROPHONE: a handheld stage mic on the 45 degree diagonal, head at the top
       right. Solid head, a grille band across it, and a HOLLOW tapering handle: the emoji
       outlines the handle rather than filling it, and a solid silhouette read far heavier than
       Windows. Even-odd: subpath 1 is the outline, 2 cuts the handle, 3 cuts the band. -->
  <StreamGeometry x:Key="HwIconMicHandheld">M 12.96,4.96 A 4.3,4.3 0 1 1 19.04,11.04 L 6.45,20.37 A 2.0,2.0 0 0 1 3.63,17.55 Z M 14.41,13.76 L 6.91,18.71 A 1.15,1.15 0 0 1 5.29,17.09 L 10.24,9.59 Z M 18.83,10.4 L 13.6,5.17 L 14.8,4.39 L 19.61,9.2 Z</StreamGeometry>

  <!-- U+2328 KEYBOARD: a flat bezel with FOUR rows of individual keys. The emoji's box is
       20x14, aspect 1.43, so the bezel is deliberately wider than tall; a square-ish body
       scaled to the same 20x20 Path box and read as the wrong glyph. Ten keys per row plus a
       spacebar row; the six-key block this replaced was the loudest shape error on the page.
       Even-odd: bezel, then the inner panel cut out, then each key filled back in. -->
  <StreamGeometry x:Key="HwIconKeyboardDetailed">M 2,6.8 A 1.8,1.8 0 0 1 3.8,5 L 20.2,5 A 1.8,1.8 0 0 1 22,6.8 L 22,17.2 A 1.8,1.8 0 0 1 20.2,19 L 3.8,19 A 1.8,1.8 0 0 1 2,17.2 Z M 3.3,6.3 L 20.7,6.3 L 20.7,17.7 L 3.3,17.7 Z M 3.75,7.65 L 5,7.65 L 5,9.15 L 3.75,9.15 Z M 5.47,7.65 L 6.72,7.65 L 6.72,9.15 L 5.47,9.15 Z M 7.19,7.65 L 8.44,7.65 L 8.44,9.15 L 7.19,9.15 Z M 8.91,7.65 L 10.16,7.65 L 10.16,9.15 L 8.91,9.15 Z M 10.63,7.65 L 11.88,7.65 L 11.88,9.15 L 10.63,9.15 Z M 12.35,7.65 L 13.6,7.65 L 13.6,9.15 L 12.35,9.15 Z M 14.07,7.65 L 15.32,7.65 L 15.32,9.15 L 14.07,9.15 Z M 15.79,7.65 L 17.04,7.65 L 17.04,9.15 L 15.79,9.15 Z M 17.51,7.65 L 18.76,7.65 L 18.76,9.15 L 17.51,9.15 Z M 19.23,7.65 L 20.48,7.65 L 20.48,9.15 L 19.23,9.15 Z M 4.05,10.05 L 5.3,10.05 L 5.3,11.55 L 4.05,11.55 Z M 5.77,10.05 L 7.02,10.05 L 7.02,11.55 L 5.77,11.55 Z M 7.49,10.05 L 8.74,10.05 L 8.74,11.55 L 7.49,11.55 Z M 9.21,10.05 L 10.46,10.05 L 10.46,11.55 L 9.21,11.55 Z M 10.93,10.05 L 12.18,10.05 L 12.18,11.55 L 10.93,11.55 Z M 12.65,10.05 L 13.9,10.05 L 13.9,11.55 L 12.65,11.55 Z M 14.37,10.05 L 15.62,10.05 L 15.62,11.55 L 14.37,11.55 Z M 16.09,10.05 L 17.34,10.05 L 17.34,11.55 L 16.09,11.55 Z M 17.81,10.05 L 19.06,10.05 L 19.06,11.55 L 17.81,11.55 Z M 19.53,10.05 L 20.78,10.05 L 20.78,11.55 L 19.53,11.55 Z M 3.75,12.45 L 5,12.45 L 5,13.95 L 3.75,13.95 Z M 5.47,12.45 L 6.72,12.45 L 6.72,13.95 L 5.47,13.95 Z M 7.19,12.45 L 8.44,12.45 L 8.44,13.95 L 7.19,13.95 Z M 8.91,12.45 L 10.16,12.45 L 10.16,13.95 L 8.91,13.95 Z M 10.63,12.45 L 11.88,12.45 L 11.88,13.95 L 10.63,13.95 Z M 12.35,12.45 L 13.6,12.45 L 13.6,13.95 L 12.35,13.95 Z M 14.07,12.45 L 15.32,12.45 L 15.32,13.95 L 14.07,13.95 Z M 15.79,12.45 L 17.04,12.45 L 17.04,13.95 L 15.79,13.95 Z M 17.51,12.45 L 18.76,12.45 L 18.76,13.95 L 17.51,13.95 Z M 19.23,12.45 L 20.48,12.45 L 20.48,13.95 L 19.23,13.95 Z M 3.75,14.85 L 5.25,14.85 L 5.25,16.35 L 3.75,16.35 Z M 5.75,14.85 L 18,14.85 L 18,16.35 L 5.75,16.35 Z M 18.5,14.85 L 20,14.85 L 20,16.3